cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use laser-line-scan in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "laser-line-scan: a browser-only structured-light laser scanner"
abstract: >-
  An open laser-perception kit: a browser-only structured-light laser scanner
  built from ES modules, Web Workers and a WebAssembly kernel compiled from
  AssemblyScript. It covers spectral illumination design, camera/laser rig
  geometry, ChArUco calibration, object scanning and dense 3D reconstruction
  with PLY and JSON export, entirely on the client.
type: software
